<title>USA: Washington Cty, Wis., won by Prudential Sec..</title>
<headline>Washington Cty, Wis., won by Prudential Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won $3.635 million of Washington, Wis., general obligation refunding bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.291 percent.</p>
</text>
